Collect Rmod Logs
    [Documentation]  Collects logs from all RMODs - either via LMI (if present) or via FHNET container (with SMOD as SSH proxy)
    ...              using 'ccsShell.sh log -c full -a -z' command.
    ...              By default logs from all available RMODs will be collected, if custom list of RMOD IDs
    ...              (with indexing started from 1) is provided, then logs will be collected only from this RMODs.
    [Arguments]      ${list_of_rmod_ids}=${None}
    ...              ${log_ru_dir}=${logs_path}/rmod_logs
    ...              ${bts_type}=GNB

    Robot Log Operation                       Collecting RMOD logs to ${log_ru_dir}
    @{list_of_rmod_ids}=   Run Keyword If     """${list_of_rmod_ids}"""=='None'
    ...     Get Rfmod List From Admin API     start_from_1=${True}    bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                    ELSE
    ...                    Copy List          ${list_of_rmod_ids}
    ${alias}                                  connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                       bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${sw_stream}                              sw_stream.get_sw_stream
    logs.create_dir_if_doesnt_exist           dir_path=${log_ru_dir}
    Alarms.Allow alarm                        fault_id=10

    Robot Log Step                            Collecting RMOD logs via LMI
    ${rsc_obj}=                               Get Library Instance
    ...                                       rsc_ops
    logs.take_snapshot_using_lmi              admin_connection=${alias}
    ...                                       logs_path=${log_ru_dir}
    ...                                       rsc_ops=${rsc_obj}

    Robot Log Step                            Collecting RMOD logs via FHNET
    ${list_of_rmod_ids}=                      rsc_ops.remove_rmods_with_lmi_connection_from_id_list
    ...                                       list_of_rmod_ids=${list_of_rmod_ids}
    ...                                       ids_start_from_one=${True}
    FOR  ${rmod_id}   IN    @{list_of_rmod_ids}
         Robot Log Step                       Collecting RMOD-${rmod_id} logs via FHNET
         Run Keyword And Continue On Failure  logs.collect_logs_from_rmod
         ...                                  path=${log_ru_dir}
         ...                                  sw_stream=${sw_stream}
         ...                                  rmod_id=${rmod_id}
         ...                                  connection=${alias}
    END

    Alarms.Disallow alarm                     fault_id=10


Enable RMODs Logs Handover To BTSLog
    [Documentation]  
    ...  Enables RMODs Log Handover To BTSLog, which means that logs from RMODs will be collected together with other BTSLog files.
    ...  Handover enabling consists of executing rad commands on RMODs, adding specific flags to swconfig and site reset.
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  - bts_type (string): BTS type, GNB or ENB; defaults to GNB;
    ...  - custom_settings (dict): custom settings for enabling RMOD logs handover to BTSLog,
    ...                            where key is configuration RMOD ID (string) and value is a list with
    ...                            custom rad commands to be executed on RMOD (via FHNET connection)
    ...                            or None if default commands should be used (default values only CPRI and eCPRI RMODs);
    ...                            i.e. {'1': ['rad -mpw 0x10041 2', 'rad -mpw 0x10042 3232300926', 'rad -mpw 0x10043 51000'],
    ...                                  '2': ['rad -mpw 0x1003f 1', 'rad -mpw 0x10040 1', 'rad -mpw 0x10041 0x2',
    ...                                        'rad -mpw 0x10042 0xAC150002', 'rad -mpw 0x10043 0xC738', 'rad -mpw 0x10045 0xF00000'],
    ...                                  '3': None}
    ...                            defaults to: None (default commands will be used for all RMODs);
    ...                            recommended value: None
    [Arguments]                                             ${bts_type}=GNB
    ...                                                     ${custom_settings}=${None}

    ${connection}=                                          connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ${rmods_protocols}                                      admin_info_model.get_rmods_protocols
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Enabling RMODs logs handover to BTSLog

    Allow DSS alarms
    Allow X2 Link Alarms

    IF    """${custom_settings}"""!="""${None}"""
        ${rmods_ids}=                                       Get Dictionary Keys
        ...                                                 ${custom_settings}
    ELSE
        ${rmods_ids}=                                       admin_info_model.get_rmod_indexes
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
        ...                                                 dist_name_type=configuration
    END

    ${is_flag_added}=                                       Set Variable    ${False}

    FOR    ${rmod_id}   IN    @{rmods_ids}
        ${rmod_protocol}=                                   Set Variable
        ...                                                 ${rmods_protocols["${rmod_id}"]}
        ${custom_commands}=                                 Set Variable If
        ...                                                 """${custom_settings}"""!="""${None}"""
        ...                                                 ${custom_settings["${rmod_id}"]}
        ...                                                 ${None}

        IF    """${rmod_protocol}"""=="""eCPRI""" or """${rmod_protocol}"""=="""CPRI""" or """${custom_settings}"""!="""${None}"""
            ${result}=                                      Run Keyword And Return Status
            ...                                             rmod_ops.enable_rmod_log_handover_to_syslog
            ...                                             connection=${connection}
            ...                                             rmod_id=${rmod_id}
            ...                                             rmod_protocol=${rmod_protocol}
            ...                                             custom_commands=${custom_commands}
            ${is_flag_added}=                               Evaluate
            ...                                             ${is_flag_added} or ${result}
        ELSE
            Robot Log Operation                             Skipping enabling RMOD-${rmod_id} log handover to BTSLog due to unsupported protocol: ${rmod_protocol}
        END
    END

    IF   """${is_flag_added}"""=="""${True}"""
        Robot Log Operation                                 Adding flags to swconfig due to RMODs log handover to BTSLog being enabled and resetting site to apply changes.
        ${btslog_flags}=                                    Create List
        ...                                                 0x200A6=1
        swconfig_operations.add_flags_to_swconfig_with_presence_check
        ...                                                 flags=${btslog_flags}
        ...                                                 bts_type=${bts_type}
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}

        admin.reset_site                                    timeout=300s
        ...                                                 connection=${connection}
    END

    [Teardown]                                              Run Keywords
    ...                                                     timer.wait_until_keyword_succeeds_timer                 
    ...                                                     300s
    ...                                                     5 sec
    ...                                                     Check all BBMODs RMODs and cells states for all RATs
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Check BTS state and all RATs states
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Disallow DSS alarms
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Disallow X2 Link Alarms
    ...                                                     AND
    ...                                                     Run Keyword If    """${KEYWORD_STATUS}"""=="PASS" and """${is_flag_added}"""=="""${True}"""
    ...                                                     Robot Log Result    
    ...                                                     RMODs log handover to BTSLog has been enabled.
    ...                                                     console=${True}
    ...                                                     ELSE
    ...                                                     Robot Log Result    
    ...                                                     RMODs log handover to BTSLog enabling has failed or partial failure has occurred.
    ...                                                     console=${True}


Start NODECPRT Pcap Collection
    [Documentation]  Start NODECPRT Pcap Collection. Keyword returns PID of tcpdump process started to collect PCAP file.
    [Arguments]    ${remote_path}
    ...            ${tcpdump_filename}
