Start collecting BIP logs
    [Documentation]
    ...  Collect L1L2 BIP Logs using gnbMirroring.sh script V61
    ...  Script repository: https://gitlabe2.ext.net.nokia.com/juhakang/tools/tree/master/gnbMirroring
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param str alias: (Optional) : Alias for l1l2bip which is also a directory name without spaces, defaults to 'L1L2_BIP_Logs'
    ...  :param int gnb_id: (Optional) : ID of gNB defined in init file under tl.gnbs object, defaults to 0
    ...  :param int timeout: (Optional) : Timeout (in seconds) for creating of interface mirroring, defaults to 300

    [Arguments]
    ...     ${alias}=L1L2_BIP_Logs
    ...     ${gnb_id}=0
    ...     ${timeout}=300

    ${webservice}=           Create Dictionary              host=${tl.gnbs[${gnb_id}].cu.oam_http_connection_details.addr}
    ...                                                     user=${tl.gnbs[${gnb_id}].cu.oam_http_connection_details.username}
    ...                                                     password=${tl.gnbs[${gnb_id}].cu.oam_http_connection_details.password}
    ...                                                     port=${tl.gnbs[${gnb_id}].cu.oam_http_connection_details.port}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting BIP collection...

    l1l2bip.create_interface_mirroring_l1l2bip_collector
    ...                                                     name=${alias}
    ...                                                     webservice=${webservice}
    ...                                                     target_file_name=tcpdump
    ...                                                     timeout=${timeout}
    ...                                                     remove_zip_file=${False}

    l1l2bip.Set suite alias                                 ${alias}
    core.setup_collectors                                   names=${alias}
    core.start_collectors                                   names=${alias}

    Sleep                                                   5s
    ...                                                     reason=Waiting additional 5s for BIP collection starting...

    Robot Log Result                                        BIP logs collecting started
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

Stop collecting BIP logs
    [Documentation]
    ...  Stops BIP Logs collecting and saves them at selected location. KW returns full path to saved BIP log file.
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param str alias: (Optional) : Alias for l1l2bip which is also a directory name without spaces for BIP log file, defaults to 'L1L2_BIP_Logs'
    ...  :param str bip_log_name: (Optional) : BIP log file name with pcap extension, defaults to 'tcpdump.pcap'.
    ...  :param str dir_path: (Optional) : Local path where BIP logs should be copied, defaults to '/home/ute'
    ...  :param int delay: (Optional) : Time (in seconds) to wait before collecting the logs, defaults to 0
    ...  RETURNS:
    ...  (str): full path to the BIP log file, example '/home/ute/results/test_1/L1L2_BIP_Logs/tcpdump.pcap'
    [Arguments]
    ...     ${alias}=L1L2_BIP_Logs
    ...     ${bip_log_name}=tcpdump.pcap
    ...     ${dir_path}=/home/ute
    ...     ${delay}=0

    Robot Log Operation                                     Stopping BIP collection and saving BIP Log file...

    ${bip_path}                                             Set variable
    ...                                                     ${dir_path}/${alias}/${bip_log_name}

    Sleep                                                   ${delay}
    core.stop_collectors                                    names=${alias}
    core.collect_collectors                                 names=${alias}
    ...                                                     target_dir=/tmp
    core.teardown_collectors                                names=${alias}
    ${rc}=                   Run And Return Rc              mergecap -a /tmp/${alias}/*mirroring_L2L1*.pcap -w /tmp/${alias}/${bip_log_name}
    Run keyword if                                          ${rc}!=0
    ...                                                     Fail
    ...                                                     msg=PCAP merging failed, check if alias does not contain spaces
    Copy File                /tmp/${alias}/tcpdump.pcap     ${bip_path}
    Remove directory         /tmp/${alias}                  recursive=True

    Sleep                                                   10s
    ...                                                     reason=Waiting additional 10s for BIP collection stopping...

    Robot Log Result                                        BIP Log has been collected successfully and saved under '${bip_path}' path.
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

    [Return]  ${bip_path}


